6
00:00:56,790 --> 00:01:02,410
And I truly believe that this is a planet that is being fought over.

7
00:01:02,410 --> 00:01:07,910
And we are beings in the midst of it.

8
00:01:09,230 --> 00:01:10,110
Just a thought.

